    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blade Ball Arena is an adrenaline-fueled, high-speed dodge brawler where precision and reflexes determine victory! Step into the arena and master the art of blade ball\u2014a thrilling fusion of dodging, deflecting, and striking. Face off against opponents in intense, fast-paced PVP battles, where every move counts and split-second decisions can mean the difference between triumph and defeat. Outsmart your rivals, unleash powerful abilities, and rise through the ranks to prove yourself as the ultimate blade ball champion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Dynamic Arenas - Unique battlegrounds to conquer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>38 Weapons - A deadly arsenal at your disposal</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 Skins - Customize your warrior and stand out in the arena</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 Abilities - Unleash game changing powers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/b3b789aa43fd8e8619cd530aaf7823e8.poster.avif?t=1744904001\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/b3b789aa43fd8e8619cd530aaf7823e8.webm?t=1744904001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/b3b789aa43fd8e8619cd530aaf7823e8.mp4?t=1744904001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Choose Your Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover your unique playstyle: Will you engage in psychological warfare, outsmarting your opponents with clever feints and unpredictable moves? Or will you rely on lightning-fast reflexes, aiming to outpace and overwhelm them with sheer speed? The choice is yours \u2014 master your approach, and climb to the top!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/37700971198b91243f7a8a79e839fe34.poster.avif?t=1744904001\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/37700971198b91243f7a8a79e839fe34.webm?t=1744904001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/37700971198b91243f7a8a79e839fe34.mp4?t=1744904001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn new abilities through participating in matches to create your perfect load out that fits your play style, whether it's aggressive or defensive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/a5c6c27393338f9bacdc534e829c7ab8.poster.avif?t=1744904001\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/a5c6c27393338f9bacdc534e829c7ab8.webm?t=1744904001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/a5c6c27393338f9bacdc534e829c7ab8.mp4?t=1744904001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalize Your Avatar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from a range of creative weapons and avatar skins, in the arena, you\u2019re the ideal you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Blade Ball Arena Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
