_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/a5c6c27393338f9bacdc534e829c7ab8.webm?t=1744904001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805120/extras/a5c6c27393338f9bacdc534e829c7ab8.mp4?t=1744904001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalize Your Avatar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from a range of creative weapons and avatar skins, in the arena, you\u2019re the ideal you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Blade Ball Arena Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
